{
  "slug": "nestjs-hexagonal",
  "name": "Nestjs Hexagonal",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Claude Code plugin for building NestJS bounded contexts with Hexagonal Architecture, DDD, CQRS, and event-driven patterns. 10\nskills, 8 agents (Opus + Sonnet), TDD workflow, GSD compatible.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **10 skills** and **8 agents**.\n\n- **Skills** (10): `application` (Use when creating application layer artifacts for a NestJS bounded context — use cases, CQRS command/query handlers, DTOs,…), `create-subdomain` (Orchestrates creation of a NestJS bounded context by dispatching specialized agents per layer (domain, application, infrastructure, presentation)), `domain` (Use when creating domain layer artifacts for a NestJS bounded context — entities (AggregateRoot), value objects, domain events,…), `event-listeners` (Use when creating event listeners that react to domain events — same-BC side effects (projections, audit, cache), cross-BC…), `gsd-installer` (Configures a NestJS project to use the nestjs-hexagonal plugin with GSD workflow), `infrastructure` (Use when creating infrastructure layer artifacts for a NestJS bounded context — Prisma repositories, in-memory repositories (testing), model…), `presentation` (Use when creating presentation layer artifacts for a NestJS bounded context — REST controllers, request DTOs with class-validator,…), `review-subdomain` (Reviews a NestJS bounded context implementation for Hexagonal Architecture + DDD + CQRS compliance), and 2 more\n- **Agents** (8): `application-agent` (Creates application layer artifacts for a NestJS bounded context — use cases, CQRS command/query handlers, DTOs, ports, and…), `architecture-reviewer` (Reviews a bounded context for Hexagonal Architecture + DDD + CQRS compliance), `broadcasting-agent` (Creates WebSocket broadcasting infrastructure (NestJS backend) and real-time consumption on the frontend (Next.js or React)), `domain-agent` (Creates domain layer artifacts for a NestJS bounded context — entities (AggregateRoot), value objects, domain events, repository interfaces,…), `event-debug-agent` (Debugs the full event chain from domain event dispatch through WebSocket delivery to frontend component consumption), `infrastructure-agent` (Creates infrastructure layer artifacts for a NestJS bounded context — Prisma repositories, in-memory repositories, model mappers, NestJS module…), `listener-agent` (Creates event listeners that react to domain events — same-BC side effects (projections, audit), cross-BC reactions (another bounded…), `presentation-agent` (Creates presentation layer artifacts for a NestJS bounded context — REST controllers, request DTOs with class-validator, Swagger decorators,…)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install nestjs-hexagonal@claude-community` from `Softtor/nestjs-hexagonal`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 10,
    "agent": 8
  },
